# Keep reports/reproduction code and reviewed compact evidence; local runs stay on disk.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!/*.md
!/*/README.md
!/*/RUNBOOK.md
!/*/STATUS.md
!/*/*.py
!/*/*.json
!/*/*.csv
!/*/*.xml
!/*/scripts/*.py
!/*/scripts/*.sh
!/*/scripts/*.md

# Aggregate evidence; do not include nested sessions, events or container environments.
!/*/evidence/*.json
!/*/evidence/*.csv
!/*/evidence/*.xml
**/image-inspect.json

# Paired probability outputs preserve reproducibility without cached image tensors.
!/feedback-finetune-20261019/analysis/*.md
!/feedback-finetune-20261019/analysis/*.json
!/feedback-finetune-20261019/analysis/*.csv
!/feedback-finetune-20261019/analysis/figures/*.png
!/feedback-finetune-20261019/analysis/figures/*.pdf
!/feedback-finetune-20261019/evaluation/*/*.json
!/feedback-finetune-20261019/evaluation/*/*.jsonl
!/feedback-finetune-20261019/delivery-verification/result.json
!/feedback-finetune-20261019/real-offline/verification.json
!/platform-feedback-20261019/fine-threshold/*.json
!/platform-feedback-20261019/fine-threshold/*.csv

# Editable meeting materials and their small chart sources.
!/meeting-20261015/*.drawio
!/meeting-20261015/*_可编辑.pptx
!/meeting-20261015/讲解备注.md
!/meeting-20261015/sources/provenance.json
!/meeting-20261015/sources/historical-pn-840.jsonl
!/meeting-20261015/sources/*.jpg
!/meeting-20261015/svg/*.svg
!/meeting-20261015/png/*.png
!/meeting-20261015/pdf/*.pdf

# Explicit guardrails for snapshots, raw data and test-generated operator trees.
**/before/
**/staging/
**/unpacked/
**/extracted/
**/delivery-extracted/
**/candidates/
**/checkpoints/
**/data/
**/input/
**/inputs/
**/.tools/
**/render-check/
**/*pytest*/
**/__pycache__/
